     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem mii-cs-onko-operation-komplikation</b></p><a name=\"en-mii-cs-onko-operation-komplikation\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcmii-cs-onko-operation-komplikation\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/shareablecodesystem.html\">Shareable CodeSystem</a></p></div><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://www.medizininformatik-initiative.de/fhir/ext/modul-onko/CodeSystem/mii-cs-onko-operation-komplikation</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">N<a name=\"en-mii-cs-onko-operation-komplikation-N\"> </a></td><td>nein</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">U<a name=\"en-mii-cs-onko-operation-komplikation-U\"> </a></td><td>unbekannt</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ABD<a name=\"en-mii-cs-onko-operation-komplikation-ABD\"> </a></td><td>Abszess in einem Drainagekanal</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ABS<a name=\"en-mii-cs-onko-operation-komplikation-ABS\"> </a></td><td>Abszess, intraabdominaler oder intrathorakaler</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ASF<a name=\"en-mii-cs-onko-operation-komplikation-ASF\"> </a></td><td>Abszess, subfaszialer</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ANI<a name=\"en-mii-cs-onko-operation-komplikation-ANI\"> </a></td><td>Akute Niereninsuffizienz</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">AEP<a name=\"en-mii-cs-onko-operation-komplikation-AEP\"> </a></td><td>Alkoholentzugspsychose</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ALR<a name=\"en-mii-cs-onko-operation-komplikation-ALR\"> </a></td